{"seq":3,"slug":"schema-contract-testing","title":"Schema 契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/schema-contract-testing","wordCount":1176,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"schema-契约测试\">Schema 契约测试</h1><p>当数据从一个系统流向另一个系统时，双方需要对&quot;数据长什么样&quot;达成共识。Schema 契约测试将这种共识形式化为可自动验证的合同：生产者承诺输出的数据结构，消费者声明依赖的数据结构，测试系统持续验证双方的承诺是否被遵守。这本质上是将微服务架构中的 API 契约测试思想应用于数据管道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Schema 契约测试的三根支柱：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>形式化契约</strong>：将&quot;数据长什么样&quot;的共识编码为机器可验证的规格，而非口头约定或文档</li>\n<li><strong>兼容性模型</strong>：BACKWARD/FORWARD/FULL 三种模式定义了 Schema 变更的安全边界</li>\n<li><strong>消费者驱动</strong>：消费者声明自己的依赖子集，生产者的变更不能破坏任何消费者</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据契约的组成要素\">数据契约的组成要素</h2><p>一份完整的数据契约不仅仅是 Schema 定义，还包括语义约束和 SLA 承诺：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>契约层</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>验证方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构层</td>\n<td>列名、类型、是否可空</td>\n<td><code>user_id: BIGINT NOT NULL</code></td>\n<td>Schema 比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义层</td>\n<td>值域、格式、业务规则</td>\n<td><code>email MATCHES regex</code></td>\n<td>数据测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系层</td>\n<td>外键、依赖、排序保证</td>\n<td><code>order.user_id EXISTS IN users</code></td>\n<td>引用完整性测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLA 层</td>\n<td>新鲜度、数据量、可用性</td>\n<td><code>数据延迟 &lt; 30min</code></td>\n<td>时效性监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>演化层</td>\n<td>兼容性规则、弃用计划</td>\n<td><code>BACKWARD compatible</code></td>\n<td>Schema Registry</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 生产者&#10;        P[数据生产系统]&#10;        PC[生产者契约]&#10;        P --&gt; PC&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 契约注册中心&#10;        CR[Schema Registry / Contract Store]&#10;        PC --&gt; CR&#10;        CC --&gt; CR&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 消费者&#10;        C[数据消费系统]&#10;        CC[消费者契约]&#10;        C --&gt; CC&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 验证&#10;        V[契约验证引擎]&#10;        CR --&gt; V&#10;        V --&gt;|兼容| OK[放行]&#10;        V --&gt;|不兼容| ALERT[告警+阻断]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 生产者\n        P[数据生产系统]\n        PC[生产者契约]\n        P --&gt; PC\n    end\n    subgraph 契约注册中心\n        CR[Schema Registry / Contract Store]\n        PC --&gt; CR\n        CC --&gt; CR\n    end\n    subgraph 消费者\n        C[数据消费系统]\n        CC[消费者契约]\n        C --&gt; CC\n    end\n    subgraph 验证\n        V[契约验证引擎]\n        CR --&gt; V\n        V --&gt;|兼容| OK[放行]\n        V --&gt;|不兼容| ALERT[告警+阻断]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"schema-演化兼容性模型\">Schema 演化兼容性模型</h2><p>Schema 变更不可避免，关键是确保变更不会破坏下游消费者。四种标准兼容性模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兼容性类型</th>\n<th>允许的变更</th>\n<th>不允许的变更</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BACKWARD</td>\n<td>新 Schema 能读旧数据</td>\n<td>删必填字段、缩窄类型</td>\n<td>消费者先升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FORWARD</td>\n<td>旧 Schema 能读新数据</td>\n<td>新增必填字段、删除字段</td>\n<td>生产者先升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FULL</td>\n<td>同时满足前后兼容</td>\n<td>上述两类的并集</td>\n<td>无协调升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NONE</td>\n<td>任意变更</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>仅开发/测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>兼容性判定的形式化规则</strong>：</p>\n<p>对于 Avro Schema，兼容性判定规则可以精确定义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BACKWARD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>valid</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext>deserialize</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> succeeds</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BACKWARD}(S_{new}, S_{old}) \\iff \\forall d \\in \\text{valid}(S_{old}): \\text{deserialize}(S_{new}, d) \\text{ succeeds}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BACKWARD</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deserialize</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> succeeds</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践中的安全变更清单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>BACKWARD</th>\n<th>FORWARD</th>\n<th>FULL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新增带默认值的字段</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增无默认值字段</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除带默认值的字段</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除无默认值的字段</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型拓宽 INT→LONG</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n<td>不安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重命名字段（+别名）</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"契约测试的实现模式\">契约测试的实现模式</h2><p><strong>模式一：Schema Registry 自动验证</strong></p>\n<p>Confluent Schema Registry 在消息注册时自动执行兼容性检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 设置 Subject 的兼容性级别&#10;curl -X PUT http://schema-registry:8081/config/orders-value \\&#10;  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\&#10;  -d &#39;{&quot;compatibility&quot;: &quot;BACKWARD&quot;}&#39;&#10;&#10;# 测试新 Schema 的兼容性（不实际注册）&#10;curl -X POST http://schema-registry:8081/compatibility/subjects/orders-value/versions/latest \\&#10;  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \\&#10;  -d &#39;{&quot;schema&quot;: &quot;{\\&quot;type\\&quot;:\\&quot;record\\&quot;,\\&quot;name\\&quot;:\\&quot;Order\\&quot;,\\&quot;fields\\&quot;:[...]}&quot;}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 设置 Subject 的兼容性级别</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> PUT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://schema-registry:8081/config/orders-value</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Content-Type: application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"compatibility\": \"BACKWARD\"}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 测试新 Schema 的兼容性（不实际注册）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> POST</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://schema-registry:8081/compatibility/subjects/orders-value/versions/latest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -H</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Content-Type: application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"schema\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"record\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Order\\\",\\\"fields\\\":[...]}\"}'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模式二：CI 中的契约测试</strong></p>\n<p>在 PR 阶段对 Schema 变更进行兼容性验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from schema_registry_client import SchemaRegistryClient&#10;&#10;def test_schema_backward_compatible():&#10;    client = SchemaRegistryClient(url=&quot;http://schema-registry:8081&quot;)&#10;    new_schema = load_schema(&quot;schemas/orders_v2.avsc&quot;)&#10;&#10;    result = client.test_compatibility(&#10;        subject=&quot;orders-value&quot;,&#10;        schema=new_schema,&#10;        version=&quot;latest&quot;,&#10;    )&#10;    assert result.is_compatible, (&#10;        f&quot;Schema 不向后兼容: {result.incompatibilities}&quot;&#10;    )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schema_registry_client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SchemaRegistryClient</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_schema_backward_compatible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SchemaRegistryClient(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://schema-registry:8081\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    new_schema </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_schema(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"schemas/orders_v2.avsc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.test_compatibility(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders-value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">new_schema,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.is_compatible, (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Schema 不向后兼容: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.incompatibilities</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模式三：Soda Data Contract</strong></p>\n<p>Soda 4.0 将 Schema 验证作为 Data Contract 的一部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"contract: user_events&#10;dataset: analytics.user_events&#10;&#10;schema:&#10;  - name: event_id&#10;    type: varchar&#10;    not_null: true&#10;    unique: true&#10;  - name: user_id&#10;    type: bigint&#10;    not_null: true&#10;  - name: event_type&#10;    type: varchar&#10;    valid_values: [&#39;click&#39;, &#39;view&#39;, &#39;purchase&#39;, &#39;signup&#39;]&#10;  - name: properties&#10;    type: jsonb&#10;    # JSON 字段的内部 Schema 验证&#10;  - name: occurred_at&#10;    type: timestamp&#10;    not_null: true&#10;&#10;# Schema 变更策略&#10;schema_evolution:&#10;  compatibility: backward&#10;  notify_on_change: true&#10;  allowed_additions: [nullable_columns]&#10;  blocked_removals: [event_id, user_id, occurred_at]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" 