=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">event_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"消费者驱动的契约测试-cdc-t\">消费者驱动的契约测试（CDC-T）</h2><p>借鉴微服务的 Consumer-Driven Contract Testing 思想，让消费者声明自己依赖的字段子集，生产者的变更不能破坏任何消费者的声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# consumer_contracts/dashboard_service.yml&#10;consumer: dashboard-service&#10;provider: order-pipeline&#10;depends_on:&#10;  dataset: public.orders&#10;  columns:&#10;    - name: order_id&#10;      type: bigint&#10;      required: true&#10;    - name: total_amount&#10;      type: decimal&#10;      required: true&#10;    - name: status&#10;      type: varchar&#10;      required: true&#10;      expected_values: [&#39;pending&#39;, &#39;completed&#39;, &#39;cancelled&#39;]&#10;    - name: created_at&#10;      type: timestamp&#10;      required: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># consumer_contracts/dashboard_service.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">consumer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dashboard-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  dataset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">public.orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bigint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">decimal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">varchar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      expected_values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">created_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">timestamp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>验证流程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>消费者将契约声明提交到中央仓库</li>\n<li>生产者在变更 Schema 时，CI 自动加载所有消费者契约并验证兼容性</li>\n<li>如果任何消费者契约被破坏，PR 被阻断</li>\n<li>生产者需要与受影响的消费者协商迁移计划</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"契约版本管理策略\">契约版本管理策略</h2><p>数据契约需要版本化管理，与 API 版本化策略类似：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语义版本</td>\n<td><code>v1.2.3</code>（major.minor.patch）</td>\n<td>正式发布的数据产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期版本</td>\n<td><code>2026-07-18</code></td>\n<td>快速迭代的内部数据集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema ID</td>\n<td>自增整数（Schema Registry）</td>\n<td>Kafka 消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git 版本</td>\n<td>commit hash</td>\n<td>与代码同步的契约</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>破坏性变更（major bump）时的迁移模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    V1[Schema v1] --&gt; B[双写期]&#10;    B --&gt; V2[Schema v2]&#10;    B --&gt; V1&#10;    V2 --&gt; C[消费者迁移]&#10;    C --&gt; D[关闭 v1]\">graph LR\n    V1[Schema v1] --&gt; B[双写期]\n    B --&gt; V2[Schema v2]\n    B --&gt; V1\n    V2 --&gt; C[消费者迁移]\n    C --&gt; D[关闭 v1]</pre><p><strong>双写期</strong>：生产者同时输出 v1 和 v2 格式，给消费者迁移时间。双写期长度由最慢消费者的迁移进度决定。</p>\n<p>Schema 契约测试确保了数据接口的稳定性，而数据值层面的质量保障则由 <a href=\"ci-cd-data-testing\">CI/CD 数据测试</a> 和运营层的 <a href=\"../operations/data-sla-alerting\">数据 SLA 与告警</a> 共同承担。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Schema 契约测试将数据接口的稳定性从&quot;靠沟通&quot;提升为&quot;靠自动化验证&quot;。兼容性模型提供了变更安全性的精确判定，消费者驱动模式确保生产者的变更不会无声地破坏下游，版本管理和双写期策略让破坏性变更可以平滑迁移。这是数据平台从&quot;共享数据库&quot;向&quot;数据产品&quot;演化的关键基础设施。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Schema 契约测试","id":"schema-契约测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据契约的组成要素","id":"数据契约的组成要素"},{"level":2,"text":"Schema 演化兼容性模型","id":"schema-演化兼容性模型"},{"level":2,"text":"契约测试的实现模式","id":"契约测试的实现模式"},{"level":2,"text":"消费者驱动的契约测试（CDC-T）","id":"消费者驱动的契约测试-cdc-t"},{"level":2,"text":"契约版本管理策略","id":"契约版本管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流式数据质量实时监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/pipeline-integration/streaming-quality-realtime"},"next":{"title":"数据 SLA 与告警体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-quality-testing/operations/data-sla-alerting"}}